From: =?UTF-8?q?Berkay=20K=C3=B6sebay?= <brkosebay@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 16:18:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: usb: describe board-selected s2idle gadget
 retention

Document apple,retain-gadget-in-s2idle: the board keeps the peripheral
controller and its PHY powered during suspend to idle, so the gadget
stays connected.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml
index b1f66a663..81df7017a 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/usb/dwc2.yaml
@@ -172,6 +172,11 @@ properties:
     description: If present indicates that we need to reset the PHY when we
       detect a wakeup. This is due to a hardware errata.
 
+  apple,retain-gadget-in-s2idle:
+    type: boolean
+    description:
+      Keep the peripheral controller and PHY powered during suspend to idle.
+
   usb-psy-name:
     $ref: /schemas/types.yaml#/definitions/string
     description:
